{"sections":[{"slug":"离散赋值环","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"离散赋值环"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">离散赋值环</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"离散赋值环"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一个离散赋值环是一个环</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">带有一个映射</span> $v\\colon A\\to\\mathbb{Z}\\cup\\{\\infty \\}$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $v(ab)=v(a)+v(b)$, $v(a+b)\\geq\\operatorname{min}(v(a),v(b))$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">等价的定义</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">仅有一个极大理想的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/主理想整环","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">主理想整环</span>"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">具有唯一不可约元的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/唯一分解整环","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">唯一分解整环</span>"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>…</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">离散赋值环是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/局部环","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部环</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}